				<p.Text>"Show the appropriate tabs on the Tab Control given the current page of the ListBar. If passed\n-1 for the current page, show all tabs and select the SEQUENCE_FILE tab.\n\nAlso, setting the value of the Tab Control causes the control to get the key focus. Therefore,\nthis VI resets the focus to the window that originally had the focus. This is necessary when\na TestStand User Interface Control originally had the focus.\n\nNote: This VI is marked to be reentrant since it is shared by multiple event callback VIs."</p.Text>
			</Comment>
